{title: Copper Kettle}
{artist: June Arden}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[D]Copper kettle o[G]n the stove
[D]Singing softly [A]while we doze
[D]Steam is rising [G]to the beam
[A]Morning driftin[D]g like a dream
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[G]Whistle low[D], whistle low
[A]Copper kettle, s[D]ing me home
{end_of_chorus}
